WEBVTT

00:01:27.697 --> 00:01:32.997
the importance of equitable
health care for all,

00:01:32.997 --> 00:01:34.930
because if you don't do that,

00:01:34.963 --> 00:01:38.697
you're not really protecting
yourselves against it.

00:01:38.730 --> 00:01:40.930
And the other point is that, of course,

00:01:40.963 --> 00:01:47.663
we've seen a large number of initiatives
under various umbrellas of WHO,

00:01:47.663 --> 00:01:53.130
or CEPI, COVAX, the Gates Foundation,
et cetera, et cetera,

00:01:53.163 --> 00:01:59.297
which really has focused
on stockpiling vaccines

00:01:59.330 --> 00:02:03.263
for equitable distribution
amongst various countries.